    <ol class="ux-specimen-index">
      <li><a href="/learning/"><span>01</span><div><h2>Learning / CLI</h2><p>Reading rhythm, amber Key Topics, purple field reference, and command-local copy feedback.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="/simple/"><span>02</span><div><h2>Simple topology</h2><p>Original outline icons, endpoint ownership, and coordinated cross-highlight.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="/complex/"><span>03</span><div><h2>Complex topology</h2><p>Independent mobile placement, deliberate sequence, and expanded pan/zoom.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>
    </ol>
    <p class="ux-review-boundary">Review before broad implementation. Nothing is merged or published in TASK-011.</p>
